	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Pridie calendas decembris per <persName ref="p20172">Ioannem Ulmium</persName>, charissimum affinem <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>meum ad te scripseram fore sperans, ut propediem abs te simul et <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>illo literas acciperem.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Sed neuter quicquam interea, dum expecto, mittit, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>quamquam, quod te quidem, mi <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> attinet, silentii tam <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>diuturni caussa nec levis nec plausibilis fuit, nempe morbus <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ille tuus, quocum graviter magnoque vitę periculo, si vera audio, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>conflictatus es, id quod sero, hoc est tum primum, quum pulchre <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>rursum convaluisse nunciabant, rescivi.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><persName>Benedictus</persName> dominus, qui te non <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>tibi, quem beatior longe sors in cęlis manebat, sed nobis et ecclesiis <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Christi pro immensa sua benignitate donavit.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Is faxit, ut reli<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>quum, quantum id est, cunque vitę tuę totum glorię suę ac membrorum <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Christi saluti constanter desudet, quemadmodum anteacta quoque <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>regni illius pomeriis fortiter proferendis prorsum fuit destinata.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Silent apud nos omnia, et bellum potiore mole in <placeName ref="l834">Italiam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>inclinaturum putant, illud puta, quod inter C[aesarem] et G[allum] geritur, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/><placeName>Germanicum</placeName> vero sopitum iri, nisi aliud forte mereatur <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>prodigiosa ista constupratissimi huius sęculi nostri ingratitudo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/><persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandus</persName> inter <persName ref="p18250">Mauricium</persName> et <persName ref="p19065">Ioannem Fridericum</persName>, <placeName ref="l749">Saxoniae</placeName> principes, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>conciliationem molitur, cuius conatus multi alii, quam <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>possunt, adiuvant; nisi enim hęc procedat, certum est miserrim<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>am praesentissimamque calamitatem imminere toti Saxonię.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Episcopus <placeName ref="l303">Mag<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>deburgensis</placeName> et, qui nuper restitutus est, <placeName ref="l1875">Hildesheimensis</placeName>, synceram <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>evangelii professionem inter suos diligenter admodum procurant; <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>quos dominus sui spiritus robore confirmet et currentes licet magis excitet.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Gallus non tam cum Caesare quam deo ipso bellum gerere videtur; <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>tot passim ignes in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> in sanctos accensos accipimus, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>quin etiam regem ipsum nuper primarię nobilitatis virum <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>cum christianissima coniuge in vincula coniecisse plurimosque <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>etiamnum <placeName ref="l301">Lugduni</placeName> in carceribus teneri, quorum sit invicta omnis <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>per dei virtutem constantia quosque par sit omnium ecclesiarum precibus <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>quotidie commendari.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Ah, quo dilapsę sunt res nostrę, ut, qui <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>christianissimo titulo salutari volunt, Christi sint infensissimi hostes.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Episcopi isti principes novum inter se nec unquam porro rumpendum <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>foedus firmissimis rationibus meditantur, ne cuilibet male<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>feriato hosti praedę fiant, <foreign xml:lang="de">das si nitt von yedem verdorbnen fursten <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>oder grauffen gevexiert muͤssind werden, wie diß und das vergangen jar.</foreign></s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>Optimus pactorum princeps servator Christus dispersas oves suas, id est <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>dei filios, congregare deque totius mundi non ferendis iniuriis mature <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>vindicare nosque inter illos dignari clementer velit, in quo tu <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>cum tota domo tua omnibusque amicis et fratribus, praecipę symmystis, ęternum <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>valeas, unice ab eo impetratum cupio.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te seque tibi reverenter <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>commendant nostri <persName>Witenbachius</persName>, <persName ref="p1057">Fuchsius</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p1057">Peter Fuchs</persName>.</note>, d. <persName>Iacobus</persName>, <persName ref="p4868">Funclius</persName> meus <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>et reliqui etc.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Iterum iterumque vale, mi charissime et optime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, mi <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>anime.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><persName ref="p20172">Ioannem Ulmium</persName>, si istic est, mea vice amanter saluta.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">28. februarii.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">T[u<lb xml:id="p1z45"/>us] <persName ref="p8055">Ambr[osius] Bl[aurerus]</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Praestantissimo pietate doc<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>trinaque viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullingero</persName>, d. <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>atque amico suo incomparabili.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
